Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Passage to Fort Cinnabar
- Story & Context: At the sun-scorched boundary marker outside Fort Cinnabar, caravan mechanic Bram traded a crate of cracked solar inverters for a warped 1983 synthesizer missing its upper octave. When an unexpected dust squall choked the camp generator during an open-air hoedown, guitarist Mae bypassed the mixer and hot-wired her vintage Telecaster directly into Bram’s battery-backed synthesizer rig, setting off an accidentally ecstatic 126 BPM groove that kept three hundred parched wanderers stomping through the yellow sand until daybreak. Amidst the smell of singed circuit solder and wild mountain sage, the whole camp locked arms and belted the chorus: "Trade the copper for the kick drum and dance the gravel down!"
